{
  "id": "r1-the-beat",
  "title": "The beat: bars and quarter notes",
  "summary": "How notation shows when to play.",
  "requires": {
    "pitchStage": "P1",
    "rhythmStage": "R1"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Bars",
      "text": [
        "Music is divided into **bars** by vertical lines across the staff.",
        "Bars help you keep your place: each one holds the same number of beats."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/q B4/q B4/q B4/q", "B4/q B4/q B4/q B4/q"]
      },
      "fingering": "none"
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "The time signature",
      "text": [
        "The two numbers after the clef are the **time signature**. The top number says how many beats are in each bar.",
        "**4/4** means four beats, so you count **1 2 3 4** in every bar."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/q B4/q B4/q B4/q", "B4/q B4/q B4/q B4/q"]
      },
      "fingering": "none",
      "labels": [
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 2,
          "text": "2"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 3,
          "text": "3"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 4,
          "text": "4"
        },
        {
          "bar": 2,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1"
        },
        {
          "bar": 2,
          "note": 2,
          "text": "2"
        },
        {
          "bar": 2,
          "note": 3,
          "text": "3"
        },
        {
          "bar": 2,
          "note": 4,
          "text": "4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Quarter notes",
      "text": [
        "A filled-in note with a stem is a **quarter note**. It lasts exactly one beat.",
        "Four quarter notes fill one bar of 4/4."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/q B4/q B4/q B4/q"]
      },
      "fingering": "none",
      "labels": [
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1 beat"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 2,
          "text": "1 beat"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 3,
          "text": "1 beat"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 4,
          "text": "1 beat"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "title": "Count out loud",
      "text": [
        "Press **Your turn**. Four clicks count you in, then play the open **B** string once on every click.",
        "Count **1 2 3 4** out loud as you play."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/q B4/q B4/q B4/q", "B4/q B4/q B4/q B4/q"]
      },
      "fingering": "first-of-bar"
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "title": "Keep counting",
      "text": [
        "The same steady beat, now moving between the three open strings. Keep counting **1 2 3 4**."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": [
          "G4/q G4/q B4/q B4/q",
          "E5/q E5/q B4/q B4/q",
          "G4/q B4/q E5/q B4/q",
          "G4/q G4/q G4/q G4/q"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
